  English, and the fallback for any device language we do not ship.

  values-pl/strings.xml holds the Polish. Keep the two files in step: a name
  that exists in one and not the other silently falls back to English, which
  reads as a half-finished translation rather than a missing one. If you add
  a string here, add it there too.
-->
